<title>USA: Hutchinson ISD 423, Minn., won by FBS Investment.</title>
<headline>Hutchinson ISD 423, Minn., won by FBS Investment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>FBS Investment Services, Inc., said it won $3.015 million of Hutchinson ISD 423, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.56 percent.</p>
</text>
